        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwani oho kwachumba Thebesi naki, ugho muzi m'baa ghwa Misri? Ghwamarilo ni machi chia rose; Moda ghwa Naili ghorekoghe kituwiro chake, na bahari ikakaia mwano ghwake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ethiopia",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3.9",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ethiopia:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Waebrania weandika Kushi.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " na Misri redeeka ndighi yake mbaa; Libya erekoghe ikimtesia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela sena wandu wa Thebesi wikadwalwa wunyika; wana wake watini werekoghe wikikabwa na kubwaghwa kutuonyi kwa kona ya kula chia. Wandu wake wikumikie wa ishima werefungiloghe na minyororo, wikawaghwa kwa kukabilwa kura ni awo wandu werewidwaeghe wunyika.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na oho Nineve wori kuchawongia kulaghalo ni akili, kuchakimbia cha kivisonyi kwendelola andu kokimbiria kwa m'maiza wako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngome rako rose reeka sa mtini ghuko na tini ra imbiri riwurue; ghukasughuswa, richapotokia momunyi kwa uo ujagha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Masikari ghenyu gheeka sa waka, na isanga jenyu ndejiwadie wulindiri imbiri ya wamaiza wenyu; luvuna lonyu lookorwa ni modo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dayenyi machi mkuwike tayari ngelo emarwa ni wamaiza; mangishenyi ngome renyu. Kotenyi nganda muiruwe; mkabe matofali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chia imweri na agho ghose, mchakorwa na modo, angu kubwaghwa wudenyi. Mchamerelwa sa vindo vajighwa ni zighe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuchurienyi mmbeni mkaie sa zighe, churikienyi mkaie sa weke mwapazi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwachurie washami wenyu kuchumba nyerinyeri ra mawingunyi, ela idana ndewiko, wainjika sa zighe raburuka noko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wabaa wenyu wa isanga weeka sa izungu ja zighe japakia awurighenyi ngelo ya mbeo; ela iji iruwa jabuka, raburuka noko, hata mndungi ndemanyagha andu raghenda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ee mzuri wa Ashuru, wabonyi nguma wako wafwa; wandu wako wa ishima wameria kufwa. Wandu wako wasaghisika aighu mighondinyi; wasowa mndungi owitumbanya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kushoghonoka kwako ndekurighitikagha, vonda varo ndeviboagha. Wandu wisikiragha malagho ghako, wichakaba chui kwa kuboilwa. Nani useichi kinyanya chako chisene kutua?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
